# Innocuous Rat: "When this creature dies, manifest dread." (CR 700.4, 701.62a). Bot1 casts the Rat on turn 1; on turn 2 Bot2's
# Lightning Bolt kills it. Its controller, Bot1 (not Bot2, who killed it), looks at the top two cards of its library, Guerrilla
# Gorilla and Lightning Bolt: the Gorilla goes onto the battlefield face down as a 2/2 under Bot1's control, the Bolt into its
# graveyard beside the Rat.

